  "description": "Welcome to your new home! On the top floor of the iconic architectural building “The Residence”, you will discover this impressive penthouse. Located in the heart of Antwerp, in the highly sought-after district of ’t Nieuw-Zuid, where tranquility and vibrant city life are perfectly balanced.\nFrom the lift, you step directly into the apartment. The tone is immediately set thanks to the high-quality materials and refined finishes. This creates an exclusive atmosphere that is fully reflected in the spacious, sun-filled living area, with the semi-open kitchen as a true eye-catcher. The combination of natural elements, clean lines and black accents creates a harmonious whole, turning cooking into a true experience. In addition, the terrace of 113 m² forms a perfect extension of the living space. With phenomenal views over the beloved city and the waters of the quays, this is a place where time seems to stand still.\nFurthermore, the property features a spacious bedroom (18 m²) that evokes a true hotel feeling thanks to the luxurious en-suite bathroom with walk-in shower and bathtub. The second bedroom (17 m²) enjoys its own outdoor space. Finally, there is a separate trendy bathroom equipped with a walk-in shower and double washbasin set in a stylish vanity unit.\nIn short, this is a place where every day feels like a unique experience, high above the city. Schedule a visit soon and let the spaces speak for themselves!\nMonthly costs: provision of €309.30 (maintenance and cleaning, electricity of common areas, syndic, insurance, waste management, etc.). Quarterly payments with annual settlement.\nTechnical details: EPC A!! Insulated floors, walls and roof. Built-in lighting, alarm system and home automation available.\nUrban planning information pending, soil certificate available. The property is not located in a flood-risk zone (P- and G-score D). Renovation obligation does not apply. As the property was built after 2001, an asbestos certificate is also not required.",
